(Underline added for clarity.)

This is itself slightly controversial, essentially because it is
occasionally impractical. Some of us have started thinking of the default
unfilled place as {zi'o .u zo'e}, essentially "while I'm not explicitly
claiming that there is something here, you should keep in mind that there
might be."

mi'e la latro'a mu'o

